H_F=  f            families
H_S=  s            sources
H_R=  r            repositories
H_M=  m            multimedia objects (media)
H_N=  n            notes
H_CITA=  c            citations
H_NAV=Navigation
H_UPDOWN=  Up/Down or k/j      move the selection
H_PAGE=  PgUp/PgDn           previous/next page
H_HOME=  Home/End            start/end
